{"id":"vorwa_rts","lemma":"vorwärts","pos":"adv","rank":1139,"glosses":["forwards, forward; onwards, onward"],"ipa":"/ˈfoːr.vɛrts/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d4/De-vorw%C3%A4rts.ogg/De-vorw%C3%A4rts.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie machten einige Schritte vorwärts.","en":"They stepped a few paces forward.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"step, footstep","l":"Schritt"},null]},{"text":"Sie bewegten sich langsam vorwärts.","en":"They moved ahead slowly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/789472","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"agitated, disturbed","l":"bewegt"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"slowly"},null]},{"text":"Tom schob sich langsam vorwärts.","en":"Tom advanced slowly.","words":[null,{"g":"to push","l":"schieben"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"slowly"},null]}]}